---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Yin-net Review - VPSTier.com" description="Yin-net offers affordable VPS hosting optimized for China traffic. Starting at ¥19.9/mo with CN2/BGP access and direct China bandwidth.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/vps" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-orange-500 text-sm mb-6 block">← Back to VPS Reviews</a>
    
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-start justify-between mb-8">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Yin-net Review</h1>
        <div class="flex gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
          <span>Commission: <strong class="text-orange-500">¥50-200/sale</strong></span>
          <span>Cookie: <strong>30 days</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://www.yin-net.com/aff.php?aff=379" target="_blank" rel="noopener" 
         class="bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
        Visit Yin-net →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <span class="text-2xl font-bold">3.9/5</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500">Developer Rating</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Yin-net specializes in VPS hosting optimized for China traffic, offering CN2 and BGP lines for low-latency domestic access. A solid choice for serving China-based users without the complexity of Aliyun.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Starting at ¥19.9/mo</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Key Features</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">CN2/BGP Lines</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Premium China-direct network routes for optimal domestic latency.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">China-Optimized</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Bandwidth specifically optimized for China mainland traffic.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">Simple Panel</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Beginner-friendly control panel with one-click OS reinstall.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">KVM Virtualization</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Full KVM isolation with dedicated resources per instance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">Multiple Locations</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Hong Kong, Los Angeles, and China datacenter options.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">DDoS Protection</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Basic DDoS mitigation included on all plans.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ CN2/BGP lines optimized for China access</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Very affordable entry-level pricing</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Simple setup and management</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Multiple Asia-Pacific datacenter options</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ DDoS protection included</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Limited global coverage outside Asia</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ English support limited</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No GPU instances available</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Smaller ecosystem vs major cloud providers</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-8">
      <a href="https://www.yin-net.com/aff.php?aff=379" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
         class="block text-center bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold transition">
        Sign Up via Our Affiliate Link
      </a>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-xs mt-3">
        We earn a commission when you sign up through our link. This doesn't affect our review.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
